    "@value" : "Marks an exploration/sweep axis to be collapsed by a statistic in the result container. When set on an ExplorationAxis, that axis's named grid dimension is reduced across every observation that carries it (e.g. an `execution.random_seed` trial ensemble becomes a first-class reduced observation). Backend-independent: states the reduction intent; the result layer applies it by dimension name."
