    "@value" : "rho_2 (ZetterbergJansen parameter)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Firing threshold (PSP) for which a 50% firing rate is achieved.\n        In other words, it is the value of the average membrane potential\n        corresponding to the inflection point of the sigmoid [mV]. Population mean firing threshold."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation" : [ {
    "@value" : "rho_2"
  } ]
