    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "The main element in a LEMS Simulation file. Defines the _length of simulation, the timestep (dt) _step and an optional _seed to use for stochastic elements, as well as _Display_s, _OutputFile_s and _EventOutputFile_s to record. Specifies a _target component to run, usually the id of a _network_"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/neuroml"
