    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Network containing: _population_s (potentially of type _populationList_, and so specifying a list of cell _location_s); _projection_s (with lists of _connection_s) and/or _explicitConnection_s; and _inputList_s (with lists of _input_s) and/or _explicitInput_s. Note: often in NeuroML this will be of type _networkWithTemperature_ if there are temperature dependent elements (e.g. ion channels)."
  } ],
