    "@value" : "node_template (slot)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Default Node attributes applied to every Node in this Network. Explicit entries in `nodes:` override the template field-by-field (shallow replace, same semantics as `dict.update`). Reserved per-Node slots (id, label, position, region) come from the data backbone (Network.iri-loaded parcellation or procedural generator) and are ignored if set on the template. Lets a homogeneous Network declare its per-Node configuration once without enumerating regions."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation" : [ {
    "@value" : "node_template"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/nodes",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/noise",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/noise_type",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@value" : "noise_type (slot)"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Temporal character of the process: `gaussian`/`white` (delta-correlated in time) or `ou`/`ornstein-uhlenbeck` (exponentially correlated in time). Governs the TIME axis only, and composes freely with `covariance`, which governs a spatial axis."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation" : [ {
    "@value" : "noise_type"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://w3id.org/tvbo/non_negative",
