  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@value" : "Shell lines run verbatim before the task command, after ``set -euo pipefail`` and any module/venv activation. The general hook for environment setup the typed fields do not cover, e.g. activating a conda env (``conda activate <name>``), sourcing a profile, or exporting a computed path. Ordered; each line is emitted as-is."
  } ],
